Thank you for your gift to <%= @chapter.name %>.

Receipt <%= @donation.uuid.first(8).upcase %>
<%= l(@donation.created_at.to_date, format: :long) %>

<% @donation.line_items.includes(wishlist: :child).each do |line| -%>
<%= line.name %><%= " (#{line.spec})" if line.spec.present? %>, asked for by <%= line.wishlist.child %>: <%= number_to_currency(line.price_in_dollars) %>
<% end -%>
<% if @donation.general_gift_in_cents.positive? -%>
Where it is needed most: <%= number_to_currency(@donation.general_gift_in_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end -%>
<% if @donation.year_end_gift? -%>
Year-end gift to <%= @chapter.name %>: <%= number_to_currency(@donation.year_end_gift_in_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end -%>
<% if @donation.fee_covered? -%>
Card processing and fees: <%= number_to_currency(@donation.fee_in_cents / 100.0) %>
<% end -%>

Total: <%= number_to_currency(@donation.charged_in_dollars) %>

<%= @chapter.legal_name_or_name %> is a 501(c)(3)<%= ", EIN #{@chapter.ein}" if @chapter.ein.present? %>. Your gift is a donation, not a purchase of goods, and no goods or services were provided to you in return. Contributions are deductible to the extent allowed by law.<% if @donation.wishlist_in_cents.positive? %> The gifts above are designated to the holiday wish list program.<% end %><% if @donation.year_end_gift? %> The year-end gift is an unrestricted donation to <%= @chapter.name %>.<% end %>
<% if @donation.wishlist_in_cents.positive? -%>

<% if @donation.gift_in_cents.positive? %>The gifts you picked are your preferences. <% end %>Everything raised for the lists is pooled and spread evenly across every child's list, and <%= @chapter.name %> retains full discretion over how the funds are allocated.
<% end -%>
